    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe i don't want to find \"meaning\" or whatever. i just feel like i'm taking up space that i don't really need to be taking up. like i'm just a ghost already, so why keep pretending i'm actually alive? it feels more like an obligation to exist than a right.",
